# 2. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project name: Real Estate ERP

Project type: Full-stack web-based Enterprise Resource Planning application.

Primary objective:

Develop a centralized real estate management system that allows a real estate company to manage its projects, property inventory, customers, sales leads, bookings, collections, customer complaints, and operational reports.

The application should provide a unified workspace for administrators and employees.

Target users:
- System Administrator
- Management / Manager
- Sales Executive
- Accounts / Collection Officer
- Customer Support Officer

The application should support multiple employees working with shared company data under role-based permissions.

Initial scope: A single-company ERP system with multiple employees. Do not introduce unnecessary multi-tenant complexity.

